# TIN TROOP: a lance kills every foe in its path; each foe beaten shows the
# running count, and every third brings a soldier back. Floating numbers
# give that many soldiers. A Pop's blast lingers a moment: a foe that walks
# into it is caught too.
game tintroop
wait 5
cheat level 0
cheat no_foes
wait 60
cheat pos 100 121
cheat foe mouse 140 130
cheat foe mouse 160 130
cheat foe mouse 180 130
cheat freeze
wait 2
hold RIGHT 2
press B
wait 30
expect kills == 3
expect lives == 20
expect count_foes == 0
# a number tag
cheat put 5 14 12
cheat pos 100 121
wait 10
hold RIGHT 40
expect lives == 25
expect tile_14_12 == 32
# the lingering blast
cheat freeze
cheat pos 100 121
cheat foe mouse 134 130 -1
wait 10
press UP+B
wait 1
expect kills == 3
wait 14
expect kills == 4
